# --- Generated documents --------------------------------------------------
# RULES.md and RULES.pdf are committed on purpose: they are the rule reference
# an astrologer reads, and a test fails if the Markdown drifts from the code.
# The intermediate HTML the PDF is rendered from is not worth tracking.
docs/RULES.html
docs/*.tmp.pdf

